      "title": "unë, ti, ai",
      "text": "The little words for the person: unë (I), ti (you), ai (he), ajo (she). With them the \"to be\" word changes: unë jam, ti je, ai është. Albanian often leaves them out, because jam, je and është already say who it is.",
